        },
        {
          "text": "Tic ma Solomon otiyo i kom ot pa Rwot otum kit meno. Solomon okelo jami ma yam wonne Daudi odyero ki Rwot-ti, ci okano ryal, ki jabu, ki jami tic-gu ducu i ot kano lim ma i ot pa Lubaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
