                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajwagi gukato woko ki i kabedo maleŋ, pien ajwagi ducu ma onoŋo gitye-ni doŋ gutyeko lonnye kekengi, ma pe giparo pi dul ticgi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci Lulevi ducu ma gin luwer, Acap ki Eman, ki Jedutun, ki awobegi, ki utmegigi, onoŋo gurukke ki boŋŋi camanini mabecone, ci gimako atego agoya, ki nana ki opuk. Kacel kwedgi obedo ajwagi ma giromo miya acel ki pyeraryo ma gin lukut tumo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.40.34+EXO.40.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 40.34-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tic pa lukut tum ki luwer en aye me ribo dwangi kacel ka pako ki ka pwoyo Rwot, ki dwangi ma winnye maloŋo. I kare ma gucako wer, kacel ki tum ki atego agoya ki jami mukene ducu me wer, pi pako Rwot kun giwero ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
